{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.finance","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Budget, Assessments & Reserves","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium fiscal infrastructure. Statutory duties and timing rules are Infrastructure; fiscal-year values, adopted amounts, schedules, reserve balances, and supporting records are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_association","admission_rule":"Statewide Illinois applicability is required. County-specific, municipal, association-customary, future-effective, or uncertain requirements are deferred until separately modeled."},"categories":[{"id":"finance.budget","label":"Annual budget"},{"id":"finance.assessments","label":"Assessments"},{"id":"finance.reserves","label":"Reserves"},{"id":"finance.accounting","label":"Financial accounting"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-9","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/9","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K9","summary":"Sharing of expenses, annual budget, assessments, and reserve requirements."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18(a)(6)-(8), 18(i)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18","summary":"Budget delivery, annual accounting, assessment procedures, and unit-owner account statements."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-4","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.4(b)-(d), (i), (k)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.4","summary":"Board duties to budget, levy and collect assessments, keep detailed financial records, and pay authorized real-property taxes and charges."}],"pages":[{"id":"finance","title":"Budget, Assessments & Reserves","help":"The descriptor separates statewide fiscal rules from the association-specific values and records that instantiate them.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-fiscal-framework","title":"Statewide fiscal framework","help":"These are statewide Illinois condominium rules, not editable association assertions.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-18","il-condo-act-18-4"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"annual-budget-duty","kind":"notice","text":"The board must prepare and distribute a detailed proposed annual budget identifying anticipated common expenses by category, anticipated assessments, other income, and each unit owner's proposed common-expense assessment.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"budget-advance-copy","kind":"notice","text":"Each unit owner must receive a copy of the proposed annual budget at least 25 days before board adoption, including an indication of portions intended for reserves, capital expenditures or repairs, or payment of real estate taxes.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"annual-accounting-duty","kind":"notice","text":"The board must annually supply unit owners an itemized accounting of the preceding year's common expenses actually incurred or paid, identifying reserves, capital expenditures or repairs, real estate taxes, amounts collected under the budget or assessments, and the net excess or deficit of income over expenditures plus reserves.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"board-financial-duties","kind":"notice","text":"The board's statewide duties include preparing, adopting and distributing the annual budget; levying and expending assessments; collecting assessments; and keeping detailed, accurate records of receipts and expenditures affecting operation of the property.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"common-expense-share","kind":"notice","text":"Each unit owner must pay the proportionate share of common expenses in the same ratio as the unit's percentage of ownership in the common elements set forth in the declaration, subject to statutory and condominium-instrument provisions.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"reasonable-reserves","kind":"notice","text":"Annual budgets must provide reasonable reserves for capital expenditures and deferred maintenance for repair or replacement of common elements, subject to the statutory reserve-waiver mechanism.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"reserve-waiver-rule","kind":"notice","text":"If the condominium instruments do not themselves require reserves, the association may waive all or part of the statutory reserve requirement by a two-thirds vote of the total association votes; a waiver must be disclosed as required by statute.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"fiscal-year-instance","title":"Fiscal-year administration","help":"Association-specific dates and retained fiscal records for the current budget cycle.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-18"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"fiscal-year-start","kind":"date","label":"Fiscal year start","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.start","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"fiscal-year-end","kind":"date","label":"Fiscal year end","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.end","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"proposed-budget-delivery-date","kind":"date","label":"Proposed budget delivered","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.proposed_budget_delivered","help":"Date the proposed annual budget was supplied to unit owners.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"budget-adoption-date","kind":"date","label":"Budget adopted","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.budget_adopted","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"annual-accounting-delivery-date","kind":"date","label":"Annual accounting supplied","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.annual_accounting_supplied","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"budget-document-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Budget document reference","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.budget_document_reference","rows":2,"help":"Reference or locator for the proposed/adopted budget retained by the association.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":4}},{"id":"annual-accounting-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Annual accounting reference","binding":"association.finance.fiscal_year.annual_accounting_reference","rows":2,"help":"Reference or locator for the annual itemized accounting supplied to unit owners.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":8,"span":5}}]},{"id":"annual-budget-summary","title":"Annual budget summary","help":"Current fiscal-year totals and detailed line items. Monetary units and presentation format are descriptor metadata.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-18"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"anticipated-common-expenses","kind":"number","label":"Anticipated common expenses","binding":"association.finance.budget.anticipated_common_expenses","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"anticipated-assessments","kind":"number","label":"Anticipated assessments","binding":"association.finance.budget.anticipated_assessments","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"anticipated-other-income","kind":"number","label":"Anticipated other income","binding":"association.finance.budget.anticipated_other_income","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"planned-reserve-contribution","kind":"number","label":"Planned reserve contribution","binding":"association.finance.budget.planned_reserve_contribution","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"planned-capital-expenditures","kind":"number","label":"Capital expenditures","binding":"association.finance.budget.capital_expenditures","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"planned-repairs","kind":"number","label":"Repairs","binding":"association.finance.budget.repairs","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"planned-real-estate-taxes","kind":"number","label":"Real estate taxes","binding":"association.finance.budget.real_estate_taxes","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"budget-line-items","kind":"collection","label":"Budget line items","binding":"association.finance.budget.line_items","help":"Detailed budget categories and amounts. Add enough items to reproduce the association's adopted budget structure.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"association_instance","min_items":1,"item_label":"Budget line","actions":{"add_label":"Add budget line","remove_label":"Remove budget line"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"budget-line-label","kind":"text","label":"Category / line label","binding":"label","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"budget-line-class","kind":"select","label":"Classification","binding":"classification","options":[{"value":"common_expense","label":"Common expense"},{"value":"assessment_income","label":"Assessment income"},{"value":"other_income","label":"Other income"},{"value":"reserve_contribution","label":"Reserve contribution"},{"value":"capital_expenditure","label":"Capital expenditure"},{"value":"repair","label":"Repair"},{"value":"real_estate_tax","label":"Real estate tax"},{"value":"other","label":"Other"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":3}},{"id":"budget-line-amount","kind":"number","label":"Amount","binding":"amount","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"budget-line-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Notes","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}}]}]},{"id":"reserve-administration","title":"Reserve administration","help":"The statute establishes the reserve framework; the actual balance, contributions, study, and any waiver are association-instance facts.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"reserve-requirement-status","kind":"select","label":"Reserve requirement status","binding":"association.finance.reserves.status","options":[{"value":"statutory_reserves","label":"Statutory reserves maintained"},{"value":"partial_waiver","label":"Partial statutory waiver"},{"value":"full_waiver","label":"Full statutory waiver"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"current-reserve-balance","kind":"number","label":"Current reserve balance","binding":"association.finance.reserves.current_balance","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"annual-reserve-contribution","kind":"number","label":"Annual reserve contribution","binding":"association.finance.reserves.annual_contribution","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"reserve-study-date","kind":"date","label":"Reserve study date","binding":"association.finance.reserves.study_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"reserve-study-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Reserve study reference","binding":"association.finance.reserves.study_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":4}},{"id":"reserve-waiver-date","kind":"date","label":"Reserve waiver vote date","binding":"association.finance.reserves.waiver_vote_date","help":"Complete when a partial or full statutory reserve waiver has been adopted.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"reserve-waiver-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Reserve waiver documentation","binding":"association.finance.reserves.waiver_reference","rows":2,"help":"Reference to the meeting record, vote evidence, and required disclosure supporting a reserve waiver.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"assessment-administration","title":"Assessment administration","help":"Regular and separate assessment values are association-instance data governed by statewide budget and assessment rules.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9","il-condo-act-18","il-condo-act-18-4"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"separate-assessment-framework","kind":"notice","text":"Illinois law distinguishes regular assessments from separate assessments and supplies owner-notice, petition, emergency/mandated-law, and additions/alterations rules for specified separate assessments.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12}},{"id":"regular-assessment-total","kind":"number","label":"Regular assessments — fiscal-year total","binding":"association.finance.assessments.regular_total","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"assessment-schedule-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Unit assessment schedule reference","binding":"association.finance.assessments.unit_schedule_reference","rows":2,"help":"Reference to the schedule showing each unit owner's proposed or adopted common-expense assessment. Unit designators remain association-local data.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-9"],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":4}},{"id":"prior-year-assessment-total","kind":"number","label":"Prior fiscal-year regular + separate assessments","binding":"association.finance.assessments.prior_year_total","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"current-year-assessment-total","kind":"number","label":"Current fiscal-year regular + separate assessments","binding":"association.finance.assessments.current_year_total","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"separate-assessments","kind":"collection","label":"Separate assessments","binding":"association.finance.assessments.separate","help":"Record each separate assessment without treating its association-specific purpose as statewide Infrastructure.","data_role":"association_instance","min_items":0,"item_label":"Separate assessment","actions":{"add_label":"Add separate assessment","remove_label":"Remove separate assessment"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"separate-assessment-name","kind":"text","label":"Name / purpose","binding":"name","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"separate-assessment-date","kind":"date","label":"Adopted","binding":"adopted_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":2}},{"id":"separate-assessment-amount","kind":"number","label":"Total amount","binding":"total_amount","min":0,"step":0.01,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"separate-assessment-years","kind":"number","label":"Fiscal years","binding":"fiscal_years","min":1,"step":1,"unit":"years","format":"integer","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"separate-assessment-class","kind":"select","label":"Statutory context","binding":"context","options":[{"value":"unbudgeted_common_expense","label":"Unbudgeted common expense / increase"},{"value":"emergency","label":"Emergency"},{"value":"mandated_by_law","label":"Mandated by law"},{"value":"addition_alteration","label":"Addition or alteration"},{"value":"other","label":"Other / not yet classified"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"separate-assessment-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Supporting record reference","binding":"document_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"owner-account-statement","kind":"notice","text":"Upon 10 days' notice to the manager or board and payment of a reasonable fee, a unit owner is entitled to a statement of the owner's account setting forth unpaid assessments or other charges due and owing.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12}}]}]}]}